---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="#0a0a0a" />
            <path d="M12 9 L21 16 L12 23" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight">Recall</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-500">
          A local knowledge base built from your coding-agent sessions. Search,
          resume, and build on everything you have already done — nothing leaves
          your machine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Product</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-neutral-500">
          <li><a href="/docs/usage" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Usage</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/development" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Development</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/releases" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Releases</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Blog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Open source</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-neutral-500">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/viggy28/recall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900">GitHub</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/recall-pi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900">npm package</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/viggy28/recall/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Issues</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/viggy28/recall/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-neutral-900">Changelog</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-6 text-sm text-neutral-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {year} Recall. MIT licensed.</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs">askrecall.dev</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
